{
 "tint": "multiply ONLY neutral grey pixels (r == g == b): rgb * role / 255. Role parts (outfit, props) are drawn grey; skin, hair, eyes, effects, every white (255,252,247) are coloured and drawn as is",
 "scale": "PNG = 2x the logical canvas 520x600 (1040x1200 px). In the 1080x1920 frame: scale 1.0 = character ~780 px tall incl. ears; two characters side by side 0.85; closeup at most 1.3. Smooth scaling (bilinear/lanczos), never nearest",
 "files": "<name>/<state>_<i>.png, all frames of one object share size, anchor and top",
 "shadow": "not baked: engine draws a soft contact shadow ellipse at anchor (w = 260*scale, h = 48*scale, black 30%)",
 "generic_states": "catch (squash-stretch) and flinch (shake) exist for every object",
 "fixed_colour": "parcel is cardboard: tint=false, drawn as is",
